  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utveckl ungt f&#xF6;retagande</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young Enterprise Developm</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let med projektet &#xE4;r att bidra till utvecklingen av det litauiska n&#xE4;ringslivet samt de internationella  aff&#xE4;rsf&#xF6;rbindelserna genom att involvera ungdomar i sektorn samt f&#xF6;renkla och m&#xF6;jligg&#xF6;ra f&#xF6;r ungdomar att starta egna f&#xF6;retag i Litauen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to improve the Lithuanian business climate for young entrepreneurs, especially concerning international relations. The project will also try to simplify and improve the possibilities for young people to start their own businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
